# FPM - Git Ignore

# Binaries built at the repository root.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash deliberately. The previous unanchored `fpm-*`
# matched at any depth, so it also ignored `charts/fpm-registry/` — the entire
# Helm chart, which was consequently never committed — and
# `nginx/fpm-location.conf`, the include nginx refuses to start without. Both
# looked fine because they existed on disk; neither was in version control.
/fpm
/fpm-cli
/fpm-registry
/main
*.exe

# Build artifacts
bin/
dist/
*.out

# Environment files with secrets
.env

# Nginx authentication file (contains password hashes)
nginx/.htpasswd

# Test packages
*.fpm
!**/*.fpm.go

# Coverage reports
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.coverprofile

# Log files
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS specific
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml

# Container volumes (if using local bind mounts)
data/

# Go specific
vendor/

# Test cache
.cache/
.fpm/

# Code search tooling artifacts
.tldr/
.tldrignore



# Offline integration test work dir (cross-built binary, fetched results)
test/offline/.work/
.wrangler/
